            "question": "Where are Monteiro Performance Fabrics made, and how is quality controlled?",
            "answer": "<p>They are made in Portugal, under ISO 9001:2015 and ISO 14001:2015 management-system certification (TÜV Rheinland), with a 10-year warranty.</p><p>Fabrics are tested in Monteiro's own laboratory and, when required, in certified third-party laboratories.</p>"
